    "「使用中」的远程作用于 fetch / 拉取 / 推送；选定与分支无关，跟随仓库保存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The remote marked \"In use\" applies to fetch / pull / push; the selection is branch-independent and saved with the repository."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「使用中」的远程作用于 fetch / 拉取 / 推送；选定与分支无关，跟随仓库保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**空闲超时**，不是总时长：每收到一段响应数据就重新计时。流式（SSE）接口只要相邻两块间隔不超过该值就不会触发；非流式接口必须能等完整个生成过程 —— 长耗时 LLM 生成建议设 120 秒以上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Idle timeout**, not total duration: the timer resets each time a chunk of response data arrives. Streaming (SSE) APIs won't trigger it as long as gaps between chunks stay below this value; non-streaming APIs must wait for the entire generation — for long-running LLM generation, set this to 120 seconds or more."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**空闲超时**，不是总时长：每收到一段响应数据就重新计时。流式（SSE）接口只要相邻两块间隔不超过该值就不会触发；非流式接口必须能等完整个生成过程 —— 长耗时 LLM 生成建议设 120 秒以上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
