    "启用后桥接脚本已生成（%@）。把左侧 JSON 合并进 ~/.zcode/cli/config.json 的 mcp.servers（通用 mcpServers 格式适用于 Claude Code / Cursor），重启客户端会话即自动连接。修改端口或重新生成 Token 后需同步更新此配置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once enabled the bridge script is generated (%@). Merge the JSON on the left into the mcp.servers section of ~/.zcode/cli/config.json (the generic mcpServers format works for Claude Code / Cursor), then restart the client session to connect automatically. After changing the port or regenerating the token, update this config accordingly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
